abstract: >
  Data analytics project introducing linear regression
  and predictive modeling with Python.
  The project emphasizes preparing data, splitting data
  into training and test sets, establishing a baseline,
  training and evaluating a regression model,
  interpreting predictions and model metrics,
  and communicating findings within a professional,
  reproducible project workflow.

